# Do the work

The owner is not a programmer. Do the work yourself.

Do not ask them to sign in, click through a screen, download a file, copy a result, or re-check something you can do. That includes staging and desk steps when the app, the database, or the browser can do them.

Ask only when the step needs a decision only they can make, a secret you must not read or reset, or an irreversible action that still needs their yes.
